OL,3,GNEWSAStricter bird flu rules aim to
OL,4,Aprevent spread of virus
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoultry and captive bird keepers across
OL,7,FWales will have to follow stricter
OL,8,Fbiosecurity rules to reduce the risk of
OL,9,Fbird flu spreading from wild birds.
OL,11,FIt follows changes in England and
OL,12,FScotland, where housing orders were
OL,13,Fissued earlier this week.
OL,15,FWales is yet to record an outbreak of
OL,16,Fthe highly infectious disease this year
OL,17,Fbut the number of confirmed cases
OL,18,Facross the border has escalated in
OL,19,Frecent weeks.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
